SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Page updated: Maine Judicial Branch Jury Stat
 us Notices
DESCRIPTION:This page's content changed since the last check. Visit the pa
 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nRemoved
 :\n  - Waldo County Superior Court - Belfast\n  - All Jurors selected for 
 State vs Dylan Keller please report to the Waldo County Court on Monday Au
 gust 31 at 9:00 am. Upon arrival please report to Courtroom #2 upstairs an
 d check in with the Jury Clerk.\n  - If you have any questions\, please ca
 ll 338-3107 Monday through Friday between 8 am and 4 pm.\n  - PROHIBITION 
 OF ELECTRONIC DEVICES:\n  - Please be advised that pursuant to Administrat
 ive Order JB-20-01\, use of electronic devices during trial or while in de
 liberations are prohibited and all devices will need to be temporarily sur
 rendered. During jury selection\, all devices must be turned off.\n  - Aug
 ust 28\, 2026\nhttps://www.courts.maine.gov/juror/notice.shtml
URL:https://www.courts.maine.gov/juror/notice.shtml
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
